  "description": "R-322 (decision 322), Unreal Engine (Packed), on the UzmiGames-authored bevelled cube, 256 px, OpenGL. Same distinct nine channel sources and Normal/AO mesh maps as R-314: field A BaseColor, grey A roughness, grey B metalness, height ramps, normal-a, hue-grid grey Opacity, field B EmissionColor, transposed hue-grid grey AO, grey173 SpecularWeight; normal-b Normal mesh and grey A AO mesh. Precondition: application shelf discovery completed before this recording, and the observed versioned URL is present. Capture preset lists, documented resource list_output_maps, dry-run lists, then exports. Probe own parameters unchanged (a refusal stays evidence of refusal); padding-only infinite leaves format, depth and dithering at actual defaults. Explicit PNG8 and TGA8 share infinite padding and disabled dithering; pipeline PNG16 uses the same processing. Repeat every probe in session and after Full save/reopen. Record actual format, depth, map names, channels, defaults and hashes; never infer them from shipped hypotheses. No UE import, DDS/cook, pilot acceptance or exact UzPainter parity is implied. Separate OCIO process with pipeline default OpenPBR channels plus added channels.",
